title: Agreement with Piłsudski
subtitle: A concrete concession under a legal procedure, or a refusal and a civilian cabinet.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_security_rules && PolishSecurity.pilsCardAvailable(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card government.pils_agreement (technical reference 16.7, 16.8.1; card catalogue 8.15): the card opens an offer,
// it does not buy a relief of pressure. An own initiative costs this month's action; the answer in the political
// crisis of a coup costs none. One agreement at a time; its relief comes once, when its execution starts.
PolishSecurity.pilsView(Q);
!}

= Agreement with Piłsudski

[+ pl_pils_line +]

Piłsudski judges an offer by its programme, the real function it gives him and the credibility of PPS; the minimal relation is only a gate. The dispute about the organisation of the supreme military authorities is the historical background; an early inspectorate and the premiership on these terms are alternatives of the game.

- @military_function
- @inspectorate
- @pils_premier
- @refuse
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@military_function
title: A military function under civilian control
subtitle: Relation 40; once executed: pressure −12, relation +4, Piłsudczycy −5 dissent; nominations up to +0.05 of loyalty to him in the group under him.
choose-if: {! return PolishSecurity.concessionStatus(Q, 'military_function').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_pils_military_function_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishSecurity.concessionChoose(Q, 'military_function');
!}
go-to: result

@inspectorate
title: An independent inspectorate with freer nominations
subtitle: Relation 60 and a change of the law, filed now; once in force: pressure −25, relation +4, Piłsudczycy −8, Centrum +8 dissent unless it shares this line; up to +0.10 of loyalty.
choose-if: {! return PolishSecurity.concessionStatus(Q, 'inspectorate').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_pils_inspectorate_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishSecurity.concessionChoose(Q, 'inspectorate');
!}
go-to: result

@pils_premier
title: Piłsudski as prime minister of a legal cabinet
subtitle: Relation 65; he becomes a candidate of the next formation of a cabinet. After his real appointment: pressure −20, relation +4, Piłsudczycy −5.
choose-if: {! return PolishSecurity.concessionStatus(Q, 'pils_premier').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_pils_pils_premier_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishSecurity.concessionChoose(Q, 'pils_premier');
!}
go-to: result

@refuse
title: Refuse concessions and offer a civilian cabinet
subtitle: No free relief of pressure; the first new civil obligation fulfilled may lower it once.
choose-if: {! return PolishSecurity.concessionStatus(Q, 'refuse').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_pils_refuse_why +]
on-arrival: {!
PolishSecurity.concessionChoose(Q, 'refuse');
!}
go-to: result

@result
new-page: true

= Agreement with Piłsudski

